WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.325
An if lets your program choose which lines to run.

2
00:00:04.451 --> 00:00:09.126
The if asks a question: does i divide by two with nothing left over?

3
00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:14.702
If yes, the lines under if run. If not, the lines under else run.

4
00:00:18.429 --> 00:00:23.979
Even sides are red, odd sides blue. Two equals signs ask; one stores.
